/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 68 0 R
/T (Within the defined scope, no Critical, High, or Medium severity issues were identified in the custom contract code. The contract exposes no post-deployment minting path, no transfer fee or tax, no blacklist or whitelist, no pausing or freezing mechanism, and no upgradeability. The owner role, as implemented, carries no token-level authority beyond standard ownership transfer and renouncement.)
/E (Within the defined scope, no Critical, High, or Medium severity issues were identified in the custom contract code. The contract exposes no post-deployment minting path, no transfer fee or tax, no blacklist or whitelist, no pausing or freezing mechanism, and no upgradeability. The owner role, as implemented, carries no token-level authority beyond standard ownership transfer and renouncement.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
