<<
/Title (The owner cannot mint, pause, freeze, tax, blacklist, or seize tokens, because no such function exists in the source. The principal centralization consideration is the initial concentration of supply and the off-chain distribution that follows, not any on-chain administrative power.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 906 0 R
/Prev 911 0 R
>>
endobj
